From: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 09:40:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: ath12k: allocate and release low-memory host resources

Consolidate consecutive changes within this functional responsibility.
Retain the final implementation and its error handling directly.

Merged from:
  338-ath12k-allow-low-memory-host-datapath.patch
  339-ath12k-fix-fixed-memory-request-lifetime.patch
  340-ath12k-bound-low-memory-rx-buffer-allocation.patch

Signed-off-by: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>

